    <string name="about_intro_title">About JRime</string>
    <string name="about_intro_summary">JRime is an Android Rime input method focused on everyday typing: shared Compose UI, a compact settings hub, user dictionary tools and desktop companions. The default schema is 小鹤双拼/飞鹤快拼 (flypy_xhfast) — other Rime schemas can be imported and switched like in any Rime frontend.</string>
    <string name="licenses_intro_title">Open source &amp; attribution</string>
    <string name="licenses_intro_summary">JRime is licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later and is built on the open source Rime ecosystem. Engine and native components are listed first, then AndroidX/Kotlin/Compose and other libraries. Tap an entry to view its license.</string>
